        {
          "type": "kotak",
          "title": "Uair has two meanings — watch the sentence",
          "items": [
            "*Uair* means **hour** as a length of time: *uair an chloig* = a full hour, *dhá uair an chloig* = two hours.",
            "*Uair* also means **time** as in \"once, twice\": *uair amháin* = once, *trí huaire* = three times. Note the plural *huaire* with an h.",
            "To ask how long: *Cé chomh fada?* (kyay khoh FAH-duh). To ask how many times: *Cé mhéad uair?*"
          ]
